  "bodyHash": "e9f5a5a413d40a03",
  "content": "\n\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>全新更新即將於 12 月 1 日推出</strong><strong><br><br>新增許多難忘的聖誕節美食，例如糖霜餅乾、薑餅人餅乾等！</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:725px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ya_hWFBTbJI\" width=\"725\" height=\"427\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>皇家糖霜：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_d554f36b-b436-4a73-a6c8-f2a114f06dd7.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_9deafdc9-ec65-4424-938b-5c643ae00576.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_208664be-6eda-409f-839f-26b19b595009.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_859cda8e-41f8-4b05-886d-8ffa237b54f1.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_09258794-4e03-40d5-87d6-1abdaaa61387.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_668bd587-50de-4953-8dea-16831a9b12b9.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_947f7385-614e-4786-a99f-9697c2b57b5d.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_d06baa24-edf5-473e-a432-07614232219e.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_084ba38c-6a84-42bb-bbe5-10c54302e083.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_de3ea470-907b-4746-8dce-afec78431842.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_5b85764c-db25-4e9b-a034-aba9370ad4a8.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_0630fe08-89ce-40d9-8580-4cf0492bd4e2.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_64b5700b-9d3e-4411-a381-831abf968330.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_c9e06695-4f75-4f8e-b6ed-57f442047050.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_c5c07984-9fe4-4e88-bd39-d70a9059f73b.png\"><br>提供 16 種不同的皇家糖霜顏色（對應所有染料顏色），可用於合成配方。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>糖霜餅乾：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_56e9fa69-2b44-4c78-aecb-ba0a3f8c71b9.png\"><br>就只是基本的糖霜餅乾，但加上一些糖霜後……嗯，現在它就是帶糖霜的糖霜餅乾了……對……</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>薑餅人餅乾：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_c0b32f34-1bae-421b-be9c-239ea8c86e0c.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_12ff036b-7758-44e3-bf28-029840b5ee7f.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_99c03ec8-2f55-44fa-a8b8-c9a197e2a8a6.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_db575c5b-9ebe-4ce5-bc2c-5d488d448234.png\"><br>經典的聖誕節餅乾。雖然因為物資短缺無法使用真正的薑，但味道依然非常接近。<br>你也可以搭配不同的糖霜來製作酷炫的圖案，當然也可以像平常一樣單純塗上糖霜。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>棉花糖：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_5d35ba6c-962f-4254-baa6-c3f6e71d49ad.png\"><br>沒錯，就只是一小團蓬鬆軟綿的美味。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>蛋酒：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_c9d7c3c9-a350-41e5-9633-712f0607602c.png\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_551b2d30-e3d7-42dd-a626-1826afe6a01e.png\"><br>一杯美味的蛋酒（無酒精），甜甜且非常甜，加一點肉桂粉可以增添香氣。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>拐杖糖：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_e890597e-6915-41ab-8b6e-807f155b49be.png\"><br>經典的聖誕節糖果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>熱可可配料：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_8ad750c6-21ad-4e10-b0fd-559655ab1fdc.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_64521bf8-e664-48f9-966d-462ca25f65a2.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_56b57b7b-b149-4923-8fd3-b713ea13d4b5.png\"><br>一直想在熱可可裡加棉花糖嗎？？現在你可以了，還可以再加一根拐杖糖，加分加分。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>巧克力條：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_37572f5b-5a4b-4afd-b450-e797c5e68e43.png\"><br>美味又不太健康，但有些東西就是值得。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>巧克力金幣：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_28706e21-ea78-4949-8ff7-feb750971c73.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_e6171d76-a13b-4552-bcb1-d99d5f09b6e1.png\"><br>將一條巧克力切分成 6 枚金幣，然後用真正的金箔包裝起來！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>冰淇淋？？？：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_5c8623fc-79f0-4c09-9094-19a2b8fcbc76.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_e464cf0f-c733-499d-b798-803a4b1dbe5.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_1c06d4dd-0a87-4df3-95e8-e44e0a8e3aec.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_23ffe5c1-3c5a-489e-8f3c-05689a46ec7b.png\">（感謝 StoneLegion 提供靈感）<br>把它想像成碗裡的甜雪吧，畢竟它真的是……對……</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>奶油乳酪甜莓捲：<img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_8f5ee258-1dc6-4600-b9a8-0a4d660e03d7.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_3a3f5bfb-c154-4cd6-9295-f86ffa1a1365.png\"><br>將甜美的莓果捲入濃郁香滑的奶油乳酪中。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>肉桂：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_75f18a59-9e88-439a-aebf-9a9c6c885a43.png\"><br>為某些料理增添少許辛辣風味。**警告：切勿生食，否則會引發<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">燃燒</span>！**</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>肉桂捲：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_1d4d830c-94b5-496f-a938-b00ee6cf14b2.png\"><br>一個口感綿密、充滿肉桂香氣的美味麵包捲。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>特別感謝 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/vanret\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanret</a></span> 全面重製了遊戲材質！&nbsp;</p>\n<p>歡迎前往 CurseForge 查看 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/vanret/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">專案頁面</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">想來看看我們剛推出的「大型爆炸物」模組嗎？</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_be19d22e-6760-4f0d-bf3c-aad119fef0e3.png\"></p>\n<p>適用於 1.20.1 Forge 與 NeoForge，以及 1.21.1 NeoForge</p>\n<p>目前就先介紹到這裡，但請務必常回來看看！這個模組仍在持續更新中！！！<br><br>如果你想撰寫模組評價或將其用於影片創作，請告訴我們，我們會將你的資訊加入描述頁中！<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_a0ccb2fc-ef33-4b68-a990-270ae21aabb3.png\"><br><br>太瘋狂了，我們居然被列為精選模組！！！<br>感謝所有下載此模組的玩家！！！ :D</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>點擊此處查看我們的「大型爆炸物」模組<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/big-explosives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1134366/description_b104836e-e491-4d4b-8c5f-adac99fb7623.png\" alt=\"大型爆炸物\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a></p>",
